WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:04.360
Tell me something.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.580
What do you know about Wakanda?

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:15.240
It's a third world country.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:18.100
Textiles, shepherds, cool outfits...

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.840
All a front.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.300
Explorers have searched for it.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.300
Called it El Dorado.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.080
They looked for it in South America.

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:33.900
But it was in Africa the whole time.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.960
I'm the only one who's seen it.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.500
And made it out alive.

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.240
Yeah, I can see you!

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:10.060
The world is changing.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.420
Soon there will only be the conquered...

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.180
And the conquerors.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:22.240
You are a good man.

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.180
With a good heart.

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:31.400
And it's hard for a good man to be a king.

